aligns, `sankeyLeft`, `sankeyRight`, `sankeyCenter` and `sankeyJustify`
(https://github.com/d3/d3-sankey, release 0.12.3, as mermaid@12.2.0 resolves it). Its header
says what changed. d3-sankey is used under the BSD 3-Clause License:

