d3-shape
--------

The file below re-implements d3-sankey's `sankeyLinkHorizontal`, which is d3-shape's
`linkHorizontal` (its `curveHorizontal` cubic) from the source's right edge to the target's
left edge (https://github.com/d3/d3-shape, release 1.3.7, as d3-sankey 0.12.3 resolves it).
